{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>近日網上流傳一段影片，見到一名穿便服男生與一名懷疑穿校服女生於海邊作出不雅行為，男生疑露出陽具。警方回覆查詢指，九龍城警區刑事支援隊經深入調查後，今日（17日）拘捕一名17歲男童，涉嫌「向年齡在16歲以下的兒童作出猥褻行為」，被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:54:04.944507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:10:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:44.569961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:30.373458+00:00","content_hash":"2443e20f20ef47ee98845949cf1a34978e3d84c004aaa0d8f783d357adb34eb7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}